# The web image is built from the repository root (docker-compose.yml, ADR-0021). It needs
# web/ and the backend files the public demo imports; nothing else goes into the context.
*
!web
!backend/src
!backend/prisma/demo-data.ts
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/dist-demo
web/coverage
web/.vite
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
